---
globs: **/*.cs
alwaysApply: false
---

- do not use "private" unless absolutely necessary, since classes and fields are by default private
- prefer to use [SerializeField] instead of public variables, if able
- do not spam unnecessary comments or documentation
- always use braces, even if there is a single line following the statement
- always use var where possible
- if you need a component attached to the current object, create a field that will hold a reference to it, and initialize it in Awake via GetComponent
- avoid IEnumerable and yield at all costs; instead, use async and tasks as much as possible
- braces are always placed on the same line, like this:

if (...) {
    ....
}

and NOT this:

if (...)
{
    ...
}
